格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"PBR 3D model preview plugin for DeepSeek Harness — GLB/GLTF game art with textures, material channel inspector, orbit controls. pbr3d fence + pbr_render tool.","id":"gh:1335730417","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"pbr-render","slug":"dhb861832993-star/pbr-render","topics":["3d","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","game-art","glb","gltf","pbr","preview"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"PBR 3D model preview plugin for DeepSeek Harness — GLB/GLTF game art with textures, material channel"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" inspector, orbit controls. pbr3d fence + pbr_render tool."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# PBRRender 🎨"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**PBR（基于物理）3D 模型预览插件 for DeepSeek Harness**\n**A Physically-Based Rendering 3D model preview plugin f"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"or DeepSeek Harness**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"渲染 GLB/GLTF 游戏美术资源，带贴图纹理、环境光照、轨道控制、材质通道检查，直接在模型回答里交互预览。\nRender GLB/GLTF game-art assets inside chat "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"with PBR textures, environment lighting, orbit controls, and material-channel inspection — fully int"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"textures, environment lighting, orbit controls, and material-channel inspection — fully interactive."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 🔌 生态 / Ecosystem：仓库已挂 `#dsh` · `#dsh-plugin` · `#pbr` · `#gltf` topic，欢迎社区收录。\n> The repo carries t"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"he `#dsh` · `#dsh-plugin` · `#pbr` · `#gltf` topics — community welcome."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 🖼️ 效果展示 / Showcase"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"同一模型的材质通道检查（点击模式栏实时切换，以下为各模式渲染截图）。\nMaterial-channel inspection of the same model (switch live via th"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"e mode bar; screenshots of each mode below)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| PBR（完整物理渲染 / Full PBR） | 基础色 / Base Color | 法线 / Normal |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| 粗糙度（灰度）/ Roughness | 金属度（灰度）/ Metallic | AO（灰度）/ Ambient Occlusion |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| 自发光 / Emissive | 线框 / Wireframe |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> 标量通道（粗糙度/金属度/AO）按 PBR 规范以**灰度**显示——正是游戏引擎（Unity/UE）读取的原始贴图通道数据。\n> Scalar channels (roughness/metal"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"lic/AO) are shown in **grayscale** per PBR convention — the raw texture-channel data game engines (U"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"nity/UE) actually read."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## ✨ 特性 / Features"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**PBR 渲染 / PBR Rendering**\n- 金属/粗糙度/法线/自发光/AO 贴图自动加载（GLB 内嵌或 GLTF 兄弟文件）\n- Metalness / roughness / no"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"rmal / emissive / AO maps load automatically (embedded in GLB or as GLTF sibling files)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**材质通道检查 / Material-Channel Inspection**\n- viewer 顶部模式栏一键切换 —— PBR / 基础色 / 法线 / 粗糙度 / 金属度 / AO / 自发光"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" / 线框\n- One-click mode bar at the top of the viewer — PBR / base color / normal / roughness / metall"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ic / AO / emissive / wireframe"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**真实 HDR 环境光 / Real HDR Environment Lighting**\n- 内置 5 种 CC0 HDR 环境图（Poly Haven 1K）—— `studio` 棚拍 / `"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"sunset` 黄昏 / `outdoor` 户外 / `sunrise` 日出 / `night` 夜晚，`env` 字段切换，`envBackground` 可显示为背景；未指定时回退程序化 Ro"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"omEnvironment。**viewer 顶部有\"环境\"切换栏，预览时可直接点击换环境**\n- 5 built-in CC0 HDR environments (Poly Haven 1K) — "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"`studio` / `sunset` / `outdoor` / `sunrise` / `night`, switched via the `env` field, or shown as the"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" background with `envBackground`; falls back to a procedural RoomEnvironment when unset. **An on-vie"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"wer \"environment\" bar lets you swap environments live**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**交互 / Interaction**\n- 拖拽旋转、滚轮缩放、自动旋转、曝光调节、**一键全屏**（右上角 ⛶ 按钮，Fullscreen API + 移动端覆盖层降级）\n- Orbit by d"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ragging, zoom with the wheel, auto-rotate, exposure control, and **one-click fullscreen** (⛶ button,"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" Fullscreen API with mobile overlay fallback)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**主动触发 / Active Triggering**\n- 模型发现 3D 模型文件（API 生成/下载/工作区出现）时自动调用 `pbr_render` 工具并渲染预览，无需用户提示\n- Auto"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"matically calls the `pbr_render` tool and renders a preview when a 3D model file appears (API-genera"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ted / downloaded / dropped into the workspace) — no user prompt needed"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**安全 / Security**\n- 文件服务工作区限定 + 扩展名白名单 + 512 MiB 上限\n- Workspace-scoped file serving + extension whit"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"elist + 512 MiB ceiling"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 安装 / Installation"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"重启 dsh web，新会话生效。\nRestart dsh web; takes effect on a new session."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 使用 / Usage"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"插件自动注入系统提示教学。模型在合适场景主动调用 `pbr_render` 工具验证路径，然后输出 `pbr3d` 围栏：\nThe plugin injects a system-prompt gui"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"de automatically. The model calls the `pbr_render` tool to validate the path, then emits a `pbr3d` f"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"tomatically. The model calls the `pbr_render` tool to validate the path, then emits a `pbr3d` fence:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\npbr3d\n{\"model\":\"E:/generated/robot.glb\",\"autoRotate\":true,\"label\":\"API 生成的机器人 / API-gen"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"br3d\n{\"model\":\"E:/generated/robot.glb\",\"autoRotate\":true,\"label\":\"API 生成的机器人 / API-generated robot\"}"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\n`"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### 围栏规格 / Fence Spec"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| 字段 / Field | 类型 / Type | 默认 / Default | 说明 / Description |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| `model` | string | **必填 / required** | 模型路径（绝对或相对工作区），.glb/.gltf/.fbx / model path (absolute or wo"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"rkspace-relative), .glb/.gltf/.fbx |\n| `autoRotate` | boolean | true | 自动旋转 / auto-rotate |\n| `backg"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"round` | string | `#14161c` | 场景背景色（`envBackground:true` 时被 HDR 背景覆盖）/ scene background color (overr"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"idden when `envBackground:true`) |\n| `env` | string | studio | 内置 HDR 环境图：`studio` / `sunset` / `out"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"door` / `sunrise` / `night`（CC0, Poly Haven 1K）/ built-in HDR environment |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 架构 / Architecture"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- `lib/index.js` — host 半边：`pbr_render` 工具 + 文件服务路由 + 系统提示段 / host half: the `pbr_render` tool + fil"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"e-service route + system-prompt section\n- `lib/client.js` — 浏览器半边：DOM 观察 `pbr3d` 围栏 → 按需加载 three 资产 "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"→ PBR 渲染 / browser half: DOM-watches `pbr3d` fences → lazy-loads the three assets → renders PBR\n- `s"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"rc/three-entry.js` + `scripts/build.mjs` — three.js 引擎打包（esbuild）/ three.js engine bundling via esbu"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"ild\n- `lib/assets/env/*.hdr` — 内置 HDR 环境图（CC0, Poly Haven 1K，RGBE 格式）/ built-in HDR environments (CC"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"0, Poly Haven 1K, RGBE)\n- `test-model.glb` / `test-tex.glb` — 演示模型（单色 + 全套贴图）/ demo models (solid-co"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"lor + full texture set)"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## 安全 / Security"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- 文件服务仅暴露工作区内的路径（防目录穿越）/ the file service only exposes paths inside the workspace (traversal-safe)\n-"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" 仅放行模型/纹理扩展名（.glb/.gltf/.bin/.ktx2/.hdr/.png/.jpg/.webp/.avif）/ only model/texture extensions are al"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"lowed\n- 文件上限 512 MiB / 512 MiB file ceiling"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
